  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v.2.0.0\n\t\t\t- Breaking: rebuilt on Aspire's AddDotnetProject; AddExternalProject now returns IResourceBuilder<DotnetProjectResource>\n\t\t\t- Breaking: relative project paths are resolved against the AppHost directory\n\t\t\t- launchSettings.json is no longer required; ExcludeKestrelEndpoints is now honored\n\t\t\t- External projects are started by Aspire instead of the IDE (Visual Studio can't launch them); opt in with LaunchFromIde\n\t\t\t- New building blocks for AddDotnetProject: WithoutIdeLaunch, WithDotnetWatch, WithDebuggerAttachCommand, WithGitPullCommand, WithGitUpToDateHealthCheck, WithSolutionGroup\n\t\t\t- Debug command finds the app whether it runs directly, under dotnet run or under dotnet watch\n\t\t\t- Debug command attaches through the Visual Studio that has the project's solution open (falls back to the AppHost's Visual Studio, then vsjitdebugger); see DebuggerAttachMode\n\t\t\tv.1.9.0\n\t\t\t- Raised minimum Aspire to 17.0\n\t\t\tv.1.8.0\n\t\t\t- Added UseWatch option to run the external project with 'dotnet watch' (recompile/hot reload on change)\n\t\t\t- Debug and Git Pull now work while an external project runs under watch\n\t\t\t- Raised minimum Aspire to 13.5\n\t\t\tv.1.7.0\n\t\t\t- Show the launch profile's launchUrl in the dashboard\n\t\t\tv.1.6.0\n\t\t\t- Updated to target .NET 10\n\t\t\t- Raised minimum Aspire to 13.4\n\t\t\t- Honor ExcludeLaunchProfile to make launchSettings.json optional\n\t\t\t- Show the 'Git Pull' output in the dashboard\n\t\t\tv.1.5.0\n\t\t\t- Updated to latest Aspire 13\n\t\t\tv.1.4.0\n\t\t\t- Updated to latest Aspire 9.3.1\n\t\t\tv.1.3.0\n\t\t\t- Added option to set the debugger launch command + arguments\n\t\t\tv.1.2.1\n\t\t\t- Fixed issue with launch profile not being set correctly\n\t\t\t- Correctly adding the command line arguments to the external project on startup\n\t\t\tv.1.2.0\n\t\t\t- Updated to Aspire 9.1.0\n\t\t\t- Added SolutionGroup property in the settings for startup-avoidance\n\t\t\tv.1.1.0\n\t\t\t- Improved pid retrieval and added option to launch a debugger from inside the external project\n\t\t\tv.1.0.0\n\t\t\t- First release",
